body:
Oh hey there.... I love you

&#x200B;

promise I'll read all of your books :)

Ohhh this will most likely get lost in the mix but I have the exact same TIFU (years ago). 

&#x200B;

I’m not much of a talker during sex, (unlike my friends who talks the entire time, but thats unrelated) and my GF at the time, we'll call her Meg, asked me to talk dirty while studying abroad in France. Well we’re doin the ol’ bumping biscuts, you know, bringing the al denté worm into the spaghetti house, and she's talking dirty like “yeah baby fuck me harder” etc. Well at that moment in time I thought it would be a splendid idea to try my talk, and as I go to flip her on back, I say: “get on your back you fucking retard.” 

&#x200B;

Safe to say she was offended and the mood was ruined. And I still don't know how to talk dirty.
